    {
      "name": "Robber's Cave (Guchhu Pani)",
      "city": "Dehradun",
      "description": "One of Dehradun's most unique natural attractions — a narrow river cave where cool water flows through rocky passages. Walking through the shallow stream surrounded by towering rock formations is a fun experience for families.",
